            "review_title": "Review at Livannah - Sips & Bites District 2",
            "review_text": "Xpatxplorer\nNew Delhi, India811 contributions\n0\nTapas style individual portions by peice\nJun 2025 • Friends\nLivannah - Sips & Bites didn’t disappoint and I can see why they’ve opened a second one in D1. Great service , food and drink. The Tapas style ordering of individual portions works really well if you are a bunch of ladies as we were. The favourites were the chicken tacos, skewers and dumplings. A suggestion is to not serve ant salt on the vegetarian dishes as that defeats the purpose of it being vegetarian😀. \nLadies they have a ladies evening on Tiesdays so do check it out! A special mention to Ha who was serving us!\nRead more\nWritten June 28, 2025\nSakal P\nDear valued customer, \nThank you so much for your visit and for sharing this feedback on Tripadvisor! We're so happy you enjoyed your time with the Livannah team. This is just the beginning, and we’d love for you to keep joining the journey with us for more good sips & fun bites!\n\nBest regards,\nSakal Phoeung\nChef-owner.\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
