            "review_text": "TheGame666\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam393 contributions\n0\nBites it is. Not a restaurant experience IMO. Fair.\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nDouble blade concept I guess.\n\nMaking a \"bites\" place, is still dining experience even if you go for \"tapas\".\n\nWent for their Valentines dining and, I have to be honest...I left hungry. They should have branded \"Valentine Apperitif\" eventually. Nobody should finish his meal....and go to another restaurant right away.\n\nThis is fancy, this is well presented. The waitress had no idea what was what...and was not able to tell us what we were having in our plate. It was ok, but doubt I will be back for diner. It suits better for a first drink of the night...not for a diner experience.\nRead more\nWritten February 17, 2025\nChez Nous\nDear valued customer,\nThank you for sharing your feedback. We're genuinely sorry to hear that your experience didn't meet expectations. Our team takes every comment seriously, and we'd love the chance to understand more so we can improve.\nLivannah team.\nRead more\nWritten June 12, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
